  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/NUFDZAKS/4c2ae7ef695e568902814ab197689b922e530236_96.webp\" alt=\"Beltborne Lanterns 圖示\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fbeltborne-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"48\"> </a>&nbsp; <a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"48\"> </a>&nbsp; <a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"https://discord.gg/9JRb3JMAD3\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\" height=\"48\"> </a>&nbsp; <a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"https://github.com/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"48\"> </a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns?display_name=release&amp;sort=semver&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=00ae5d\" alt=\"最新版本\"></p><h1>Beltborne Lanterns — 雙手解放，光芒隨行</h1><p>手持燈籠時按下 <strong>B</strong> 鍵，燈籠便會扣在腰帶上。行走、跳躍、戰鬥——燈籠會 <strong>隨物理律動搖擺</strong>，並 <em>在你身旁照亮光芒。</em> 想收回手中嗎？再按 <strong>B</strong> 鍵即可。💡</p><hr><h2>🧩 為何如此出色</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>一鍵操作，毫無繁瑣。</strong> 無需翻找背包：按下 <strong>B</strong> 即可快速裝上或取下燈籠。</li>\n<li><strong>活生生的光芒。</strong> 物理效果讓光線更真實——移動轉向時燈籠會輕柔搖曳。</li>\n<li><strong>沉浸不犧牲。</strong> 雙手自由，光芒相伴——探索、建造、生存。</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>⚙️ 使用方法&nbsp;</h2><ol>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">手持燈籠。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">按下 <strong>B</strong> 鍵——燈籠會扣在腰帶上。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">四處走動——燈籠隨你搖擺，並 <em>在你身旁照亮光芒。</em></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">再次按下 <strong>B</strong> 鍵——燈籠便會脫離。<br><br></li>\n</ol><blockquote>\n<p><em>動態光照備註：</em> 遊戲中的實際光照效果需要安裝動態光照模組——詳見常見問題。</p>\n</blockquote><hr><h2>⧉ 附加元件</h2><p><strong>Beltborne Lanterns - 配件層</strong>:&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns-Accessories-Layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a></p><hr><h2>📷 展示</h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo1.webp\" alt=\"展示 1\" width=\"380\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo2.webp\" alt=\"展示 2\" width=\"380\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo3.webp\" alt=\"展示 3\" width=\"380\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo4.webp\" alt=\"展示 4\" width=\"380\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo5.webp\" alt=\"展示 5\" width=\"380\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo6.webp\" alt=\"展示 6\" width=\"380\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>&nbsp;</h2><hr><h2>❓ 常見問題 — 相容性與多人模式</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>能在多人模式中使用嗎？</strong> — <strong>可以！</strong><em>（需要用戶端與伺服器端皆安裝）</em></li>\n<li><strong>在原始 Minecraft 中會發光嗎？</strong> — <strong>不會。</strong> 請安裝動態光照模組以獲得腰帶燈籠的光照效果：\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fabric / Quilt / NeoForge</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flambdynamiclights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LambDynamicLights</a></li>\n<li><strong>替代方案（NeoForge）</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Lights (AtomicStryker)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>與靈魂燈籠相容嗎？</strong> — <strong>可以！</strong></li>\n<li><strong>與其他模組的燈籠相容嗎？</strong> — <strong>可以！</strong> 將其 <strong>物品標籤</strong> 新增至設定的相容清單即可。</li>\n<li><strong>與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faccessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a> 模組相容嗎？</strong> — <strong>可以</strong>，請安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Beltborne Lanterns: 配件層</strong></a> 附加元件。</li>\n<li><strong>與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffirst-person-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">第一人稱模型</a> 模組相容嗎？</strong> —&nbsp;<strong>可以</strong>，而且效果絕佳！&nbsp;<em>（截圖收於摺疊區）</em>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/152920d7a3299d971640438bc0bbb7eaea029728.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>📜 授權條款</h2><p>本專案採用 <strong>Apache License 2.0</strong> 授權——詳情請參閱 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns/settings/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a> 檔案。<br>完整授權條文：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache 2.0</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">以 ❤️ 為 Minecraft 社群精心打造</p>",
